      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "5 Wallace Road, Walkinstown, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are proud to present new to the market for sale no.5 Wallace Road. This superb 2 bedroom house located in the heart of Walkinstown welcomes a great opportunity for any growing family or couple.\r\n\r\nThis property is surrounded by a host of local amenities including Bunting park, many shops, cafes and restaurants and sports facilities. It is also in close proximity to Crumlin Village which is rich in amenities as well.\r\n\r\nThe first thing to mention in this property is the cosy front reception room, moving past this you enter a modern kitchen/dining area which is bursting with colour and natural light, this open space encapsulates modern living and also makes for a fantastic entertaining space. An extended family room completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a sunny and private back garden with plenty of space and potential to be made into a quiet and tranquil space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two bedrooms, a double to the rear with bespoke fitted wardrobes, and a larger master bedroom to the front aspect. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nWallace Road benefits from fantastic public transport links with several bus routes such as the F3 and 27 running through the area. The M50 motorway is also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful property is not one to be missed so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Extended\r\n- Modern interior\r\n- Large back garden\r\n- Prime location"
      },
